### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- description: Speech-to-text transcription via Crazyrouter API (OpenAI Whisper). Transcribe audio/video files to text. Supports mp3, mp4, wav, m4a, webm. Use when user asks to transcribe audio, extract text from video, or convert speech to text.
- license: MIT
- acceptLicenseTerms: true
- 2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts`
- npx -y tsx ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --input audio.mp3
- npx -y tsx ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --input meeting.m4a --output transcript.txt
- npx -y tsx ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --input chinese.mp3 --language zh
- npx -y tsx ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --input french.mp3 --translate
